  "control_source_check": {
    "first_1c56": "PENDING=$91 is cleared by framebuffer_init_impl (pinned candidate src/enemy_runtime.s:1286); main.s:707-710 waits while it is nonzero, so the first natural Attract dispatch at $1C56 is reached with PENDING=0. The pinned complete-profile presentation_flow_tick cold path calls start_screen and then clears MENU_EVENT=$D0, MENU_SELECT=$E0, and MENU_DIRTY=$E1 (candidate src/presentation_runtime.s:184-193). The receipt profile is complete, and the compiled active module listing shows the matching instructions at $192F/$1931/$1933. No input preserves these cleared menu controls through Attract startup.",
    "first_b830": "Attract entry $1C56 calls its timer, stores the page-23 callback pointer, and invokes the resident gateway; actor overlay is later (candidate src/presentation_runtime.s:744-762). The page-23 callback at $B830 calls highscore_logo_tick before menu_tick (candidate src/shared_text_stage.inc:1306-1311). No source action between $1C56 and $B830 arms PENDING. On the no-input path, the cold-start D0/E0/E1 clears remain in effect through the first callback.",
    "outcome": "The first $1C56 and $B830 controls are source-supported: PENDING=0 from framebuffer init/mainloop gating, and menu event/selection/dirty zero from the complete-profile cold-start clears plus no-input Attract path. This is source and compiled-artifact evidence, not runtime evidence."
  },
